8. NP2kai and Main_MiSTer tables
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Small data tables are transcribed from NP2kai
   (https://github.com/AZO234/NP2kai):
   - the port 0x9A0 query table in src/pc9821/core/pc9821_iobus.sv;
   - the ATAPI MODE SENSE page words in src/pc9821/storage/pc9821_atapi.sv;
   - rows of the BIOS key table (bios/keytable.res: the normal and shift rows
     for key codes 0x00-0x34, and the arrow keys of row 0x38) in
     tools/mister/ztype.py (BIOS_NORMAL, BIOS_SHIFT, ARROW_PC98, test data);
   - the PC-98 key numbers and the symbols the BIOS key table gives (keystat.tbl
     names, bios/keytable.res) in tools/gen_keymap_table.py (PC98_KEYS).

