   A subset of the PS/2 set-2 key codes of Main_MiSTer's input.cpp ev2ps2[]
   table (https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer, GNU General Public
   License version 3) is transcribed in tools/mister/ztype.py (EV2PS2, test
   data) and tools/gen_keymap_table.py (the set-2 codes of PC_KEYS). The values
   are the standard PS/2 scan-code set 2 assignments; they are listed here so
   their source is on record. No other Main_MiSTer code is copied.

   Other projects (NP2kai, qemu-pc98, MAME, ymfm, nukeykt's YM2608-LLE, ReC98)
   are cited in comments as behavioural references; no other code is copied
   from them.

