--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The FPGA bitstream (.rbf) combines this project's Apache-2.0 code with the
   parts above, among them GPL code: the framework (part 2) and the sound
   cores (part 3). The GNU General Public License terms of those parts apply
   to the bitstream, and this repository is its corresponding source.
   The Apache License 2.0 is compatible with GPL version 3 (not with GPL
   version 2 alone). The GPL parts here state "version 2 or later" or
   "version 3 or later" in their headers, or "GPL Licensed" with no version;
   the sys/ files with no header carry only the Template_MiSTer repository's
   LICENSE, the GPL version 2 text. No file in sys/ or src/opna/ states
   "version 2 only". See each file's header. The BSD (part 4) and MIT (part 8)
   parts are compatible with GPL version 3. Part 6 is used only in simulation
   and is not in the bitstream. Parts 5 and 7 are described in their sections.
